040191             0342*   pingo_flat_lookup_bytes: equ pingo_flat_material_count * pingo_flat_band_count
040191             0343*   
040191             0344*   ; Surface contract: generated terrain uses flat_pattern + scene illumination.
040191             0345*   ; Runways, pavement, and markings remain separate objects using flat_palette
040191             0346*   ; + self illumination; do not add them to the terrain pattern material table.
040191             0347*   
