04090E             1286*   ; Unsigned 24-bit integer square root used by the camera look-at solver.
04090E             1287*   ;
04090E             1288*   ; This is deliberately an internal-width exception to the library's normal
04090E             1289*   ; logical-low-word convention: the radicand is a genuine UHL:H:L value.
04090E             1290*   ; Camera position inputs and emitted angles remain 16-bit, and the solver
04090E             1291*   ; bounds its squared horizontal intermediate below 2^23 before calling here.
