040D48             1882*   ; normalized 16-bit coefficient, so the matrix occupies 18 bytes.
040D48             1883*   ;
040D48             1884*   ; inputs:
040D48             1885*   ;   ix -> six-byte source/destination vec3
040D48             1886*   ;   iy -> 18-byte row-major matrix
