048836             0696*   ; Normalize the mutable camera position into the manager's proposed axial
048836             0697*   ; origin.  IX is opaque to the manager but is the fixture's p3d camera state
048836             0698*   ; here.  The closed hex has Pingo-local corners
048836             0699*   ;
048836             0700*   ;   (x,z) = (0,-5120),(4400,-2560),(4400,2560),
048836             0701*   ;           (0,5120),(-4400,2560),(-4400,-2560).
048836             0702*   ;
048836             0703*   ; Hence the sloped half-plane witness is exactly
048836             0704*   ;
048836             0705*   ;   1024*abs(x) + 1760*abs(z) <= 9,011,200.
048836             0706*   ;
048836             0707*   ; Both (0,5120) and (4400,2560) evaluate to 9,011,200.  Rebase does not occur
048836             0708*   ; on that ownership boundary.  The current origin retains a fixed 256-count
048836             0709*   ; (16 m) outward band.  For each sloped edge the exact integer witness is
048836             0710*   ;
048836             0711*   ;   round(256*sqrt(1024^2+1760^2)) = 521,271,
048836             0712*   ;   retained half-plane RHS = 9,532,471.
048836             0713*   ;
048836             0714*   ; The expanded vertical and tip quick bounds are respectively 4,656 and
048836             0715*   ; 5,376 counts.  Exact outer-limit ties retain the current origin; the first
048836             0716*   ; integer beyond a limit selects a neighbor.  The branch order below gives
048836             0717*   ; corners a deterministic vertical-before-sloped tie rule.  After a rebase,
048836             0718*   ; applying the same expanded hex around the new origin supplies the symmetric
048836             0719*   ; deadband, so boundary jitter cannot immediately select the old origin.
048836             0720*   ; Axis checks reduce arbitrarily displaced signed-word inputs before the
048836             0721*   ; multiplication, so each unsigned product and sum fits in 24 bits.
048836             0722*   terrain_provider_normalize_position:
048836 FD E5       0723*       push iy
048838 AF          0724*       xor a
048839 32 A4 8B 04 0725*       ld (hex_provider_origin_changed),a
